        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/73ab20/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-06T04:40:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As if regular <strong>Fix</strong>er didn't gain enough from <strong>Fix</strong>ed Point.</p><p>Basically, just don't ever let Fixer leave the Time Cataclysm.&nbsp; In the normal world he's an old blind guy who fixes cars.&nbsp; The spacetime continuum has to be falling apart at the seams before he becomes ungodly powerful, because he's so Zen that he waited the entire history of the cosmos for one perfect moment in which to do all his being-awesome in.</p>",
